            "<p><strong>Writer / Poet</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Works &amp; Contribution</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Rabindranath Tagore</strong></p>",
            "<p>1861–1941; \"Gitanjali\" (Nobel 1913); Gora; Ghare Baire; wrote Jana Gana Mana &amp; Amar Sonar Bangla</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Bankim Chandra Chattopadhyay</strong></p>",
            "<p>1838–94; \"Anandamath\" (Vande Mataram); Durgeshnandini; Father of Bengali novel</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Michael Madhusudan Dutt</strong></p>",
            "<p>1824–73; \"Meghnad Vadh Kavya\"; introduced blank verse in Bengali</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Sarat Chandra Chattopadhyay</strong></p>",
            "<p>1876–1938; \"Devdas\"; \"Parineeta\"; \"Srikanta\"; widely read Bengali novelist</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Bibhutibhushan Bandyopadhyay</strong></p>",
            "<p>1894–1950; \"Pather Panchali\" — Satyajit Ray made it into Apu Trilogy film</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Kazi Nazrul Islam</strong></p>",
            "<p>1899–1976; \"Rebel Poet\"; also loved in WB; \"Bidrohi\" poem; national poet of Bangladesh</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Sunil Gangopadhyay</strong></p>",
            "<p>1934–2012; \"Sei Samay\"; \"Prothom Alo\"; Sananda magazine</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Mahasweta Devi</strong></p>",
            "<p>1926–2016; activist writer; \"Hajar Churashir Maa\"; Sahitya Akademi; Magsaysay Award</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Jibanananda Das</strong></p>",
            "<p>1899–1954; \"Banalata Sen\"; Modernist Bengali poet</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Satyajit Ray</strong></p>",
            "<p>1921–1992; filmmaker &amp; writer; Padma Bhushan; Oscar; created Feluda &amp; Professor Shonku</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
